{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desktop Town</strong> is a relaxing <strong>idle city builder</strong> that runs directly on your desktop. <strong>Build</strong>\u00a0and <strong>decorate</strong> your own tiny town, or\u00a0<strong>watch</strong> your little citizens go about their day, while doing your usual tasks on the PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When there\u2019s nothing else to do, simply watch your citizens as they wander around and go about their day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748960/extras/05f2c3fa831e89012d7e98d4e35107ae.poster.avif?t=1760375141\" width=956 height=606 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748960/extras/05f2c3fa831e89012d7e98d4e35107ae.webm?t=1760375141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748960/extras/05f2c3fa831e89012d7e98d4e35107ae.mp4?t=1760375141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your Town</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of modular blocks to design your town exactly the way you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748960/extras/f192993e32e1fb6fb2c561cf3868ed2a.poster.avif?t=1760375141\" width=956 height=606 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748960/extras/f192993e32e1fb6fb2c561cf3868ed2a.webm?t=1760375141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748960/extras/f192993e32e1fb6fb2c561cf3868ed2a.mp4?t=1760375141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add plants, lanterns, and a wide range of other decorations to bring your town to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748960/extras/7de12d45c6c7dac0230742113634da96.poster.avif?t=1760375141\" width=956 height=606 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748960/extras/7de12d45c6c7dac0230742113634da96.webm?t=1760375141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748960/extras/7de12d45c6c7dac0230742113634da96.mp4?t=1760375141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3748960?t=1760375141","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748960/65b729bcfbac6b6d57199ef958b773ec0b691964/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760375141","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748960/e4811f900b852f64168d24e43c60d433a1a004de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760375141","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748960/e4811f900b852f64168d24e43c60d433a1a004de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760375141","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4021960,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desktop Town</strong> is a relaxing <s